Package: pcscd
Name: PC/SC Lite daemon
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libpcsclite1 (>= @VERSION@), libiosexec1 (>= 1.2.2)
Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://pcsclite.apdu.fr/
Description: PC/SC smart card daemon
 Built on-device. Loads IFD handlers from /usr/lib/pcsc/drivers and
 serial configs from /etc/reader.conf.d (px4-userland IFD).
 No libudev/libusb hotplug. launchd job: fr.apdu.pcscd.
